    "status": "finding",
    "summary": "Fire damage is stored in six affector files as staged lists rather than as blast damage. The incendiary grenade holds stages 15, 10 and 5 with floats 2.5, 7 and 10 on a 0.1 interval; the airburst incendiary holds 10 / 15 on a 0.3 interval and the thermobaric grenade 8 / 2 and 5 / 1.5 on 0.4. The fields are unnamed, so whether these are damage per second by fire age is a candidate that needs one in-game reading. 58 raw-offset checks matched.",
